#. module: partner_invoicing_mail_filename
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:partner_invoicing_mail_filename.field_res_partner__invoice_pdf_filename
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:partner_invoicing_mail_filename.field_res_users__invoice_pdf_filename
msgid ""
"Partner-specific invoice PDF filename template.\n"
"You can use Jinja-like placeholders which are rendered dynamically when generating the filename:\n"
"\n"
"  {{ object.name }}             → Invoice reference\n"
"  {{ object.partner_id.name }}   → Partner name\n"
"  {{ object.invoice_date }}      → Invoice date\n"
"\n"
"  Example:\n"
"  Invoice_{{ object.name }}_{{ object.partner_id.name }}\n"
"\n"
"If left empty, the default report filename is used."
msgstr ""
"Partnerspezifische PDF-Dateinamenvorlage für Rechnungen.\n"
"Sie können Jinja-ähnliche Platzhalter verwenden, die beim Generieren des Dateinamens dynamisch gerendert werden:\n"
"\n"
"  {{ object.name }}             → Rechnungsreferenz\n"
"  {{ object.partner_id.name }}   → Partnername\n"
"  {{ object.invoice_date }}      → Rechnungsdatum\n"
"\n"
"  Beispiel:\n"
"  Rechnung_{{ object.name }}_{{ object.partner_id.name }}\n"
"\n"
"Wenn das Feld leer bleibt, wird der Standarddateiname des Berichts verwendet."
